add('High','Protected preview; source-confirmed','Holiday list refers to a missing data route',['/holiday'],'Review the authorized view preview; normal account access is 403.','The authorized layout renders HTTP 500 because holidaycalendar_data is undefined. Its DataTables initializer also depends on the missing plugin described in UI-05.','Use a real endpoint and an available table implementation.','resources/views/holidaycalendar/index.blade.php:52');
