findings[11].evidence += ' Resolution: replaced the nonexistent AJAX route and DataTables initializer with escaped server-rendered holiday rows and existing native search/sorting/pagination. Controller supplies all rows for client filtering and permission-checked action buttons with the correct holiday resource parameter. scripts/qa-holiday-preview.php rendered the actual route using in-memory permissions only; tests/Browser/holidays.cjs verified that the normal account still receives 403, then tested that preview at phone/desktop widths without JavaScript errors, seven existing row links and search/no-results/reset. No holiday or permission records were saved; successful create/update/delete operations are outside this check. Original observation above is retained as audit history.';
add('Medium','Reproduced; direct resource routes','Chat resource screens are incomplete or crash',['/chat','/chat/create','/chat/1','/chat/1/edit'],'Open these direct resource URLs.','List: missing chat route parameter. Create/edit: controller methods absent. Detail: null attachment URL call. The normal conversation page is /chat/main.','Implement supported screens or stop exposing unsupported resource routes.','app/Http/Controllers/ChatController.php:58; resources/views/chats/component/chat_message.blade.php');
